# A decomposed accent (i + U+0308 combining diaeresis) stays in one word, so there is one DS0001.
mode: syntax
---- query
from t | project naïve
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..25
  PIPELINE@0..24
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    NAME_REF@5..6
      IDENT@5..6 "t"
    WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
    PIPE@7..8 "|"
    WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
    PROJECT_OP@9..16
      IDENT@9..16 "project"
    WHITESPACE@16..17 " "
    ERROR@17..24
      ERROR@17..24 "nai\u{308}ve"
  WHITESPACE@24..25 "\n"

error[DS0001]: names with non-ASCII characters must be quoted: `naïve`
  --> query:1:18
  |
1 | from t | project naïve
  |                  ^^^^^^ unquoted name with non-ASCII characters
  |
  = help: quote the name: `['naïve']`
  = note: unquoted names use only the letters A-Z and a-z, digits and `_`
